  "phase": "24_kvcache_flash_attention_benchmark",
  "methodology_note": "Fuses the attention core (QK^T*scale+bias, softmax, AV) for window_size=14 blocks into one native MPS dispatch using online/streaming softmax (simdgroup_half8x8 tile ops) with K/V cached once per (window, head) in threadgroup memory and shared across all ~25 query-tile simdgroups, instead of each tile independently re-reading K/V from device memory. See this script's module docstring for the full 5-design history and why each earlier one failed.",
